# The standalone Trickshot checkout at the repo root. Anchored so the pattern
# cannot also match src/components/trickshot, src/app/trickshot, … — Tailwind
# v4 source detection respects .gitignore, and a bare name here silently
# dropped every class used only by the replay components from the compiled CSS.
/trickshot/
